<!-- formalization -->

**Definition (`InfoSys.closure`).** The closure of a consistent finite set $u$ is the element whose carrier consists of the data entailed by $u$.

**Theorem (`InfoSys.closure.subset`).** Every token of a consistent finite set belongs to the carrier of its closure.

*Proof.* Reflexivity of entailment. □

**Theorem (`InfoSys.closure.mem_iff`).** Membership in the closure carrier is entailment from $u$.

*Proof.* Unfolding. □

**Theorem (`InfoSys.theorem_35`).** A consistent finite set sits under its closure.

*Proof.* The subset property of closure. □
